{"test_class": {"identifier": "MqttClientProviderTest", "superclass": "", "interfaces": "", "fields": [{"original_string": "private Vertx vertx = Vertx.vertx();", "modifier": "private", "type": "Vertx", "declarator": "vertx = Vertx.vertx()", "var_name": "vertx"}], "file": "jetlinks-components/network-component/mqtt-component/src/test/java/org/jetlinks/community/network/mqtt/client/MqttClientProviderTest.java"}, "test_case": {"identifier": "test", "parameters": "()", "modifiers": "@Test", "return": "void", "body": "@Test\n    void test() {\n        MqttServer server = MqttServer.create(vertx);\n\n        server.endpointHandler(endpoint -> {\n            endpoint\n                    .accept()\n                    .publish(\"/test\", Buffer.buffer(\"test\"), MqttQoS.AT_MOST_ONCE, false, false);\n        }).listen(11223);\n\n        MqttClientProvider provider = new MqttClientProvider(id -> Mono.empty(), vertx);\n\n        MqttClientProperties properties = new MqttClientProperties();\n        properties.setHost(\"127.0.0.1\");\n        properties.setPort(11223);\n        properties.setOptions(new MqttClientOptions());\n\n        VertxMqttClient client = provider.createNetwork(properties);\n\n        client.subscribe(Arrays.asList(\"/test\"))\n                .map(MqttMessage::getPayload)\n                .map(payload -> payload.toString(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))\n                .take(1)\n                .as(StepVerifier::create)\n                .expectNext(\"test\")\n                .verifyComplete();\n\n\n    }", "signature": "void test()", "full_signature": "@Test void test()", "class_method_signature": "MqttClientProviderTest.test()", "testcase": true, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["create", "listen", "endpointHandler", "publish", "accept", "buffer", "empty", "setHost", "setPort", "setOptions", "createNetwork", "verifyComplete", "expectNext", "as", "take", "map", "map", "subscribe", "asList", "toString"]}, "focal_class": {"identifier": "MqttClientProvider",